{
    "title": "Block Puzzle: Block Smash Game",
    "description": "<b>Block Smash Journey</b> [Block Puzzle game], is an excellent block puzzle game that improves your logic skills & refreshes your mind. It combines the free classic block puzzle game with the excellent cube block smash game, making it perfect for those who enjoy puzzle games, Cube block smash games & block smash games\r\n\r\n<b>HOW TO PLAY?</b>\r\n\u2b50 Drop blocks to create & destroy full lines on the screen both vertically & horizontally. \r\n\u2b50 Try to crush as many cubes as possible & break your highest score with the help of a fresh new rotation prop.\r\n\u2b50 Game over if no more space for extra blocks.\r\n\r\n<b>FEATURES OF BLOCK SMASH: BLOCK PUZZLE GAME </b>\r\n\u2b50 100% free & offline support.\r\n\u2b50 Stress-relieving & brain-healthy\r\n\u2b50 Easy to pick up, but hard & challenging to be a master Block Smash Journey\r\n\u2b50 Diversity of adventure mode & free classic block puzzle mode\r\n\r\nBonus points & fantastic elimination animations are awarded in this Block Smash Journey block puzzle game when multiple rows or columns are cleared simultaneously. \r\n\r\nWhat are you looking for?\r\nLet's take a break & enjoy this challenging <b>Block Puzzle: Block Smash game</b> together now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Block Smash Journey</b> [Block Puzzle game], is an excellent block puzzle game that improves your logic skills &amp; refreshes your mind. It combines the free classic block puzzle game with the excellent cube block smash game, making it perfect for those who enjoy puzzle games, Cube block smash games &amp; block smash games<br><br><b>HOW TO PLAY?</b><br>\u2b50 Drop blocks to create &amp; destroy full lines on the screen both vertically &amp; horizontally. <br>\u2b50 Try to crush as many cubes as possible &amp; break your highest score with the help of a fresh new rotation prop.<br>\u2b50 Game over if no more space for extra blocks.<br><br><b>FEATURES OF BLOCK SMASH: BLOCK PUZZLE GAME </b><br>\u2b50 100% free &amp; offline support.<br>\u2b50 Stress-relieving &amp; brain-healthy<br>\u2b50 Easy to pick up, but hard &amp; challenging to be a master Block Smash Journey<br>\u2b50 Diversity of adventure mode &amp; free classic block puzzle mode<br><br>Bonus points &amp; fantastic elimination animations are awarded in this Block Smash Journey block puzzle game when multiple rows or columns are cleared simultaneously. <br><br>What are you looking for?<br>Let&#39;s take a break &amp; enjoy this challenging <b>Block Puzzle: Block Smash game</b> together now!",
